+## 6. Client-side computation still present (grep evidence)
+
+The frontend still **previews** some values for legacy/pre-quote rendering, but the backend is the only
+authority that is ever charged. The task's grep, with the honest reading of each hit:
+
+| Hit | File:line | Status |
+|---|---|---|
